= Saxonian affairs 

With Saxonian SPD in critical condition between it's far left unwilling to ever peace out with bourgeoisie and it's right wing splitting into ASPD, we have lost considerable power here. 

- @negotiate_asdp: Attempt to negotiate with ASPD.
- @assault_aspd: Attack ASPD and their policies.
- @return: We shall not do anything here.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@negotiate_asdp
choose-if: not spd_left and not spd_centrist
unavailable-subtitle: Our stance is clearly unfavored by ASPD, reformist splinter.
on-arrival: aspd_relation += 3; reformist_strength += 3; saxony_timer = 12; pro_republic += 1

